WEBVTT

01:40.040 --> 01:41.320
Place it here.

01:41.400 --> 01:42.560
Place it over there.

01:43.080 --> 01:44.360
The tall one. Yes.

01:44.440 --> 01:46.520
Be careful. That pot of flowers is rare.

01:46.600 --> 01:47.920
Come and put it over there.

01:48.480 --> 01:49.920
Father, I won.

01:52.400 --> 01:55.520
I didn't expect you to improve so much

01:57.000 --> 01:58.520
under Li'er's tutelage.

01:58.600 --> 02:00.520
Under her tutelage?

02:00.600 --> 02:03.080
I'm the one who's talented.

02:05.000 --> 02:06.400
You're right.

02:06.480 --> 02:08.800
You're obviously gifted.

02:09.360 --> 02:10.199
Aunt Lu.

02:10.880 --> 02:12.520
- Li'er.
- You're giving me so many flowers.

02:12.600 --> 02:14.200
Yes, they're in full bloom.

02:14.280 --> 02:15.640
It's perfect for your place.

02:15.720 --> 02:16.560
Li'er.

02:16.640 --> 02:17.680
Uncle Yuanping.

02:19.840 --> 02:20.880
Come on, have some tea.

02:21.840 --> 02:23.080
This is my favorite.

02:23.960 --> 02:25.200
Eating is all you know.

02:26.440 --> 02:27.520
Well…

02:27.600 --> 02:28.760
Li'er,

02:30.120 --> 02:32.480
I'm so glad you've helped

02:32.560 --> 02:34.280
Rui'er grow.

02:34.360 --> 02:36.080
I never ever dreamed

02:36.160 --> 02:39.040
that this no-good brat would be able
to receive an honor at the palace.

02:39.760 --> 02:41.240
My dear niece,

02:41.320 --> 02:44.760
- I really don't know how to thank you.
- Yes, Li'er.

02:44.840 --> 02:47.720
It's really all thanks to you.

02:48.400 --> 02:49.400
We're a family.

02:49.920 --> 02:51.840
Don't say that.

02:51.920 --> 02:53.120
Must the three of you

02:54.480 --> 02:55.760
be so hypocritical?

02:55.840 --> 02:57.000
- Jiang Jingrui!
- Jiang Jingrui!

02:57.080 --> 02:58.640
- What?
- I'll beat you up. I…

03:01.600 --> 03:02.800
Dear!

03:02.880 --> 03:04.400
- What happened, Mother?
- What's wrong, dear?

03:04.480 --> 03:06.000
- My back.
- What's wrong with your old back?

03:06.080 --> 03:07.200
It's your back that's old.

03:07.280 --> 03:08.800
Dear, come and I'll give you a massage.

03:08.880 --> 03:09.960
Don't touch me.

03:11.160 --> 03:12.320
- Dear.
- Tong'er.

03:15.400 --> 03:16.240
Let's go.

03:16.320 --> 03:17.800
Come on. Quickly.

03:17.880 --> 03:19.480
Let me see where it hurts.

03:19.560 --> 03:20.480
- Where?
- Down there.

03:22.520 --> 03:23.480
What's the matter?

03:26.760 --> 03:27.960
I heard

03:28.040 --> 03:30.240
that Zhou Yanbang
wants to be engaged to you.

03:30.920 --> 03:31.880
Zhou Yanbang

03:32.520 --> 03:33.960
has been spoiled since he was a child

03:34.480 --> 03:36.000
and has no qualms about doing

03:36.080 --> 03:37.000
whatever comes to mind.

03:37.520 --> 03:38.360
Don't mind him.

03:38.440 --> 03:40.560
Marquis of Ningyuan grounded him.

03:40.640 --> 03:43.560
These days, his family has been working

03:43.640 --> 03:45.080
on suppressing this matter.

03:45.160 --> 03:46.000
Is that so?

03:46.080 --> 03:48.120
But that's karmic justice.

03:48.200 --> 03:51.280
Back then, Aunt Shuran
was in a hurry to switch you out

03:51.360 --> 03:52.920
with Jiang Ruoyao just a few days

03:53.480 --> 03:55.320
after you went to Zhennv Hall.

03:59.200 --> 04:00.040
It hurts!

04:02.120 --> 04:06.160
In broad daylight,
you're being lovey-dovey

04:07.120 --> 04:09.160
and showing affection for each other.

04:09.720 --> 04:10.640
How inappropriate!

04:12.520 --> 04:15.000
- Yuanbai, what brings you here?
- Yuanbai, what brings you here?

04:15.760 --> 04:17.399
I should be the one asking you.

04:18.760 --> 04:23.280
It's inappropriate to come here
and flirt with each other

04:23.760 --> 04:24.800
in broad daylight!

04:24.880 --> 04:27.960
Yuanbai, I sprained my back.

04:28.040 --> 04:31.040
Yuanping was helping to treat me.

04:31.120 --> 04:32.720
She sprained her old back.

04:32.800 --> 04:33.960
You're…

04:35.880 --> 04:36.880
Yuanbai.

04:36.960 --> 04:37.960
Yuanbai.

04:38.040 --> 04:43.160
- What's wrong?
- Last night, I overworked my old back.

04:44.120 --> 04:44.960
Yuanbai.

04:45.440 --> 04:46.480
Give me a massage.

04:47.120 --> 04:47.960
Go.

04:48.040 --> 04:50.520
Yuanbai, let me give you a massage.

04:52.000 --> 04:55.120
Jingrui got first place in the Annual Exam

04:55.200 --> 04:56.400
thanks to Li'er's tutelage.

04:56.960 --> 04:59.640
We're here to thank her.

05:00.320 --> 05:01.720
Do you want to crush me?

05:01.800 --> 05:02.720
Be gentler.

05:02.800 --> 05:04.320
Go home and massage your old backs.

05:04.400 --> 05:05.240
Dear.

05:06.040 --> 05:07.720
Come on.
I'll massage your old back at home.

05:08.440 --> 05:09.920
- Rui'er!
- Coming.

05:11.040 --> 05:14.560
- I'll go ahead.
- Come, dear. Be careful.

05:15.760 --> 05:16.800
Come on.

05:16.880 --> 05:18.040
- Mother.
- Be careful.

05:19.080 --> 05:20.960
- Look.
- Jingrui, let's carry her.

05:21.840 --> 05:23.760
Your mother weighs
almost as much as a sow.

05:23.840 --> 05:25.360
How inappropriate!

05:26.280 --> 05:27.120
Father.

05:28.400 --> 05:29.480
Slow down.

05:36.600 --> 05:39.360
I've been busy with work
in the past few days.

05:39.440 --> 05:41.080
I only heard about you getting first place

05:41.160 --> 05:43.920
in the Annual Exam
when His Majesty praised me.

05:44.520 --> 05:46.840
I haven't even held a banquet
to celebrate for you.

05:46.920 --> 05:49.800
In thinking about your studies
at the School of Integrity,

05:51.640 --> 05:54.120
I've been negligent.

05:54.200 --> 05:55.840
Father, you don't have to blame yourself.

05:56.560 --> 05:58.920
I'm used to it
after ten years in Zhennv Hall.

05:59.560 --> 06:01.320
I don't think I should disturb you

06:01.880 --> 06:03.440
with my affairs
at the School of Integrity.

06:03.520 --> 06:07.400
I was worried you wouldn't be able
to cope with your studies

06:07.480 --> 06:08.760
at the School of Integrity,

06:08.840 --> 06:12.520
so I thought I'd be adding
to your worries by asking too much.

06:12.600 --> 06:16.040
I didn't expect you to be good
not only at calligraphy,

06:16.120 --> 06:18.200
but also at playing the guqin.

06:23.760 --> 06:26.120
I'm so glad.

06:27.120 --> 06:30.600
There was a girl at Zhennv Hall
who was a guqin player.

06:31.280 --> 06:32.920
I just learned from her.

06:33.000 --> 06:35.920
Before she left,
she left me her guqin and music score

06:36.000 --> 06:37.320
to let me practice more.

06:37.400 --> 06:40.360
I was scolded by the chief
for delaying cleaning work a few times

06:40.440 --> 06:43.000
because I was practicing the guqin.

06:43.080 --> 06:45.560
You've suffered.

06:45.640 --> 06:48.080
There's nothing to hide
between a father and a daughter.

06:48.880 --> 06:49.880
I have no secrets.

06:50.520 --> 06:52.840
If you have any questions, just say so.

07:06.600 --> 07:07.600
I know

07:08.200 --> 07:10.920
you were engaged to Zhou Yanbang.

07:11.560 --> 07:13.920
But that engagement
became Ruoyao's later on.

07:14.000 --> 07:16.520
I never asked you about your thoughts.

07:25.000 --> 07:26.320
Father, you're worrying too much.

07:27.560 --> 07:29.480
I've never liked Zhou Yanbang.

07:30.560 --> 07:32.960
Not in the past, not now,

07:33.640 --> 07:35.000
and not in the future.

07:35.080 --> 07:39.520
If he comes to you
to change the engagement…

07:39.600 --> 07:40.760
Like you said,

07:41.360 --> 07:43.120
it was him who proposed it.

07:43.200 --> 07:44.640
I didn't initiate it.

07:45.280 --> 07:48.120
Besides, I've already refused.

07:48.680 --> 07:51.480
Are you bringing it up now
because you don't believe me?

07:51.560 --> 07:52.440
No.

07:54.000 --> 07:55.960
Fine, let's not talk about it.

07:56.040 --> 07:57.920
I'll throw you

07:58.000 --> 07:59.560
a celebration banquet another day.

07:59.640 --> 08:03.200
You should be rewarded
for making the Jiang family proud.

08:03.280 --> 08:04.240
Thank you, Father.

08:04.800 --> 08:06.320
All right. I'll go ahead.

08:17.400 --> 08:18.240
Miss.

08:20.640 --> 08:21.480
Look.

08:22.360 --> 08:24.240
I can only rely on myself.

08:24.320 --> 08:25.880
If I hadn't made a name for myself

08:25.960 --> 08:27.520
in this Annual Exam,

08:28.440 --> 08:29.800
I wouldn't have surpassed this

08:30.280 --> 08:31.840
and would be blamed instead.

08:31.920 --> 08:33.840
You got first place this time.

08:33.919 --> 08:35.440
His Majesty will personally reward you

08:35.520 --> 08:37.600
and you've established
your reputation in the capital.

08:37.679 --> 08:39.760
It'll be easier for you
to do things in the future.

08:39.840 --> 08:42.080
Her ladyship will surely be pleased
as she watches over us

08:42.559 --> 08:43.840
from above.

08:44.520 --> 08:47.520
Consider the possible dangers
when you're safe and be prepared.

08:48.560 --> 08:50.520
It's not the time to rest easy.

08:51.080 --> 08:55.480
I'm afraid the real danger lies ahead.

09:05.400 --> 09:06.280
Idiot!

09:08.800 --> 09:09.640
Father,

09:10.120 --> 09:12.400
I just randomly mentioned becoming a monk.

09:12.480 --> 09:15.000
They didn't take it seriously.
Why are you being serious about it?

09:15.960 --> 09:18.240
Besides, if I really become a monk,

09:18.320 --> 09:19.480
our family will be dishonored.

09:19.560 --> 09:20.600
Honor?

09:20.680 --> 09:22.720
So now you're thinking
about our family's honor.

09:22.800 --> 09:25.160
What have I been relying on
in the imperial court all these years?

09:25.240 --> 09:26.080
Honoring my word.

09:26.920 --> 09:28.280
You've made a mess before,

09:28.360 --> 09:29.840
so swallow the consequences today.

09:29.920 --> 09:30.920
But Father,

09:31.000 --> 09:32.800
you can't really let me
become a monk, can you?

09:32.880 --> 09:34.200
Why not?

09:34.280 --> 09:37.000
Jiang Li was stuck
in Zhennv Hall for ten years

09:37.080 --> 09:38.600
and still managed to get first place.

09:38.680 --> 09:39.880
Look at yourself.

09:39.960 --> 09:41.800
I hired teachers for you
for over ten years

09:41.880 --> 09:43.120
and what do I get?

09:43.200 --> 09:44.320
You've accomplished nothing.

09:44.840 --> 09:46.520
Yes, Father. I know I'm wrong.

09:46.600 --> 09:48.600
I'll study twice as hard

09:48.680 --> 09:49.760
and never be left behind.

09:49.840 --> 09:51.040
It's too late now.

09:51.120 --> 09:52.400
Everyone in the capital

09:52.480 --> 09:53.680
knows about your bet now,

09:53.760 --> 09:55.560
so I can't protect you anymore.

09:56.440 --> 09:58.200
Stay in the temple.

09:58.280 --> 10:00.160
If you do well
and when the matter dies down,

10:00.240 --> 10:01.880
I might have a chance to get you out.

10:02.440 --> 10:04.600
You can take the chance
to change your cocky ways too.

10:04.680 --> 10:05.520
Take him away.

10:05.600 --> 10:06.840
Father.

10:06.920 --> 10:07.760
Wait.

10:08.320 --> 10:10.080
Father. Li Jin.

10:10.160 --> 10:11.040
Plead for me.

10:11.120 --> 10:12.680
Li Jin, plead for me.

10:12.760 --> 10:15.120
Li Jin. Father!

10:15.200 --> 10:16.560
I don't want to be a monk, Father.

10:16.640 --> 10:17.760
I haven't gotten married yet.

10:17.840 --> 10:19.520
I haven't given you
a grandson yet, Father.

10:19.600 --> 10:21.760
Don't let me become a monk, Father.

10:22.320 --> 10:23.320
Why are you laughing?

10:25.000 --> 10:26.600
I just feel pity that my beloved brother

10:27.200 --> 10:28.960
can't understand your good intentions.

10:30.320 --> 10:31.800
It's just a show for Eldest Princess.

10:32.280 --> 10:34.480
For the sake of Eldest Princess' ambition

10:34.560 --> 10:35.920
as well as Prince Cheng's,

10:36.600 --> 10:39.520
our family even sacrificed a son.

10:39.600 --> 10:40.960
If they succeed in the future,

10:41.960 --> 10:44.480
our family will be
the most meritorious one.

10:48.840 --> 10:50.520
When did you realize this?

10:50.600 --> 10:51.880
A son of a distinguished family

10:52.480 --> 10:53.880
betting with a girl in the street

10:53.960 --> 10:55.120
is so absurd and ridiculous,

10:55.200 --> 10:57.000
but you didn't stop it.

10:57.080 --> 10:58.760
From that moment on, I thought

10:59.840 --> 11:01.400
you must have another reason.

11:01.480 --> 11:02.480
Tell me.

11:04.320 --> 11:07.760
What would you do next if it were you?

11:07.840 --> 11:09.760
Why are we going around a big circle

11:09.840 --> 11:11.720
to make a fuss about Ye Shijie?

11:12.720 --> 11:14.440
If we go

11:15.680 --> 11:16.840
straight to Luyang

11:17.320 --> 11:18.560
and take drastic actions,

11:18.640 --> 11:19.560
won't the Ye family

11:20.440 --> 11:23.080
soon come under your control?

11:24.560 --> 11:26.120
Don't give me any more trouble.

11:36.280 --> 11:38.560
Why can't you even handle a little girl?

11:40.560 --> 11:42.960
I thought the Li brothers
could deal with her,

11:43.480 --> 11:46.080
but I didn't expect Zhou Yanbang
to be charmed by her.

11:46.160 --> 11:49.080
If she even wins Jiang Yuanbai's heart,

11:49.560 --> 11:50.880
it'll be too late.

11:50.960 --> 11:53.560
A wild girl who spent ten years
in Qingcheng Mountain

11:54.200 --> 11:57.160
fooled you as soon as she
came back to the Jiang family.

11:57.240 --> 12:00.960
Now, she got first place
in the Annual Exam

12:01.040 --> 12:03.080
and she almost overturned
the School of Integrity.

12:03.160 --> 12:05.320
As the stepmother
who raised her since she was little,

12:05.920 --> 12:07.880
don't you think
there's something fishy about this?

12:07.960 --> 12:10.240
I know you're trying to say

12:10.320 --> 12:12.120
that she's not Jiang Li.

12:12.960 --> 12:14.880
I'm not that stupid.

12:14.960 --> 12:17.960
To check on this,
I've especially looked into the person

12:18.040 --> 12:20.160
who wants to kill Jiang Li the most.

12:21.960 --> 12:24.720
Were you the chief of Zhennv Hall
in Qingcheng Mountain?

12:26.320 --> 12:27.560
Do you want to be released?

12:31.080 --> 12:32.360
Who are you?

12:33.360 --> 12:35.280
The Chief Secretariat's wife sent me.

12:35.360 --> 12:36.640
What does she want from me?

12:36.720 --> 12:38.000
I have a question for you.

12:38.080 --> 12:39.520
If you give me a satisfactory answer,

12:39.600 --> 12:41.320
Madam Ji will get you out.

12:41.400 --> 12:42.680
What's the question?

12:46.360 --> 12:47.840
Look who this is.

12:51.280 --> 12:54.240
Isn't she Ms. Jiang Li?

12:55.720 --> 12:57.480
Look carefully.

12:57.560 --> 12:59.680
She stayed with me for ten years.

13:01.040 --> 13:05.680
I could recognize her
even if she was burned into ashes.

13:06.680 --> 13:08.640
When Liu Yuanfeng disclosed the scandal

13:08.720 --> 13:10.640
of Zhennv Hall in front of His Majesty,

13:10.720 --> 13:13.080
Jiang Li was his witness.

13:13.640 --> 13:15.200
Zhennv Hall's chief hates her to the core.

13:15.280 --> 13:17.360
If her identity is fake,

13:17.440 --> 13:19.120
she surely wouldn't help her hide it.

13:19.200 --> 13:22.240
She's clearly Jiang Li,

13:22.320 --> 13:24.840
but she's just very cunning

13:24.920 --> 13:28.240
and hides herself well before everyone.

13:28.320 --> 13:31.800
In that case, she can't be kept around.

13:31.880 --> 13:33.000
What else can I do?

13:34.600 --> 13:36.960
Do you remember the Shen family's case?

13:40.320 --> 13:43.040
Do you mean Madam Xue?

13:44.320 --> 13:47.680
Madam Xue was caught in adultery,
fled to the mountains,

13:47.760 --> 13:48.920
and ended up dead.

13:49.960 --> 13:52.640
A woman's greatest fear
is to lose her virtue.

13:56.160 --> 13:59.440
They're being summoned
to the palace in a few days, right?

14:00.280 --> 14:03.160
If she lost her virtue in the palace,

14:03.800 --> 14:05.160
it would be difficult

14:05.960 --> 14:08.360
even for Chancellor Jiang
to cover up in front of His Majesty.

14:08.440 --> 14:10.760
Chancellor Jiang favors her now,

14:10.840 --> 14:12.480
but you don't have to be angry.

14:13.440 --> 14:15.320
Raise her reputation first

14:15.400 --> 14:18.640
and she will naturally fall badly.

14:18.720 --> 14:20.360
This is the palace.

14:20.440 --> 14:23.080
I'm afraid it'll be hard to clean up
if things get out of hand.

14:23.640 --> 14:25.200
What do you take me for?

14:25.840 --> 14:27.880
I won't harm your husband.

14:27.960 --> 14:31.360
With me in the palace,
you can rest assured.

14:34.800 --> 14:40.120
JIANG RESIDENCE

14:52.280 --> 14:53.680
Greetings, Grandmother.

14:54.760 --> 14:56.760
His Majesty is granting us
a banquet at the palace.

14:56.840 --> 14:59.000
As the Jiang family
got first place in the Annual Exam,

14:59.080 --> 15:00.840
we should dress decently,

15:00.920 --> 15:02.760
especially you.

15:02.840 --> 15:04.760
It's your first time entering the palace,

15:04.840 --> 15:07.000
so you should dress up carefully.

15:07.600 --> 15:08.760
I especially got items

15:08.840 --> 15:11.080
from some of the most famous shops
in the capital

15:11.160 --> 15:12.480
for you to choose from.

15:12.560 --> 15:13.600
Grandmother,

15:14.200 --> 15:17.200
I'm entering the palace
to be rewarded in the name

15:17.280 --> 15:18.200
of the Jiang family.

15:19.200 --> 15:21.840
You can decide what you want me to wear.

15:21.920 --> 15:22.840
Look at you.

15:23.320 --> 15:25.400
You're passing the buck to me.

15:26.320 --> 15:29.280
Fine. I'll decide for you.

15:40.840 --> 15:43.280
You won first place,

15:43.840 --> 15:45.800
so you should dress
with elegance and dignity.

15:45.880 --> 15:49.120
This silk is plain but elegant

15:49.200 --> 15:50.160
with a soft texture.

15:50.640 --> 15:52.760
If it's made into a dress,

15:53.480 --> 15:55.000
it'll suit your temperament.

15:55.480 --> 15:56.680
What do you think?

15:57.320 --> 15:58.560
I really like it.

15:59.600 --> 16:00.520
Thank you, Grandmother.

16:00.600 --> 16:03.080
Ms. Zhang, show them the way out.

16:03.640 --> 16:04.480
Yes.

16:09.800 --> 16:11.760
You grew up in Zhennv Hall,

16:12.840 --> 16:15.920
but your bearing
is like your birth mother's.

16:16.560 --> 16:18.120
You look like a noblewoman.

16:18.680 --> 16:20.200
Thank you for the compliment, Grandmother.

16:21.480 --> 16:23.080
Everyone praises you outside.

16:23.560 --> 16:26.120
How can we be stingy
with compliments at home?

16:26.200 --> 16:28.440
I'm so happy to be able to see you

16:28.520 --> 16:30.080
as you are today.

16:30.560 --> 16:32.080
After ten years of separation,

16:32.960 --> 16:35.000
I didn't expect you to develop

16:35.080 --> 16:36.840
such a good character and skill.

16:37.840 --> 16:40.760
I dare not let you and my father down.

16:40.840 --> 16:45.080
Good. You're a good child
of the Jiang family.

16:47.680 --> 16:50.120
I'd like to say a few more words.

16:50.200 --> 16:51.960
Since you're the Jiang family's child,

16:52.680 --> 16:57.160
you must share
the family's prosperity and loss.

16:57.720 --> 16:59.000
The palace is not like home.

16:59.080 --> 17:00.480
Be careful in everything.

17:00.560 --> 17:01.880
Take care of yourself

17:01.960 --> 17:03.480
and your sisters.

17:03.560 --> 17:07.079
The world is full of deceitful people.

17:07.160 --> 17:08.920
If anything happens,

17:09.000 --> 17:11.000
don't keep the grievance to yourself.

17:11.760 --> 17:13.240
Come back and tell me.

17:13.319 --> 17:16.160
All right. I got it.

17:25.880 --> 17:26.839
What are you doing?

17:28.480 --> 17:32.240
Mother, I'm not going
to the palace banquet.

17:32.320 --> 17:33.760
His Majesty is hosting the banquet.

17:34.360 --> 17:36.200
You can't just not go.

17:36.280 --> 17:38.280
His Majesty wants
to see the first placers.

17:38.360 --> 17:40.000
I'm just a sidekick.

17:40.080 --> 17:42.080
It doesn't matter whether I go or not.

17:51.000 --> 17:51.840
Ruoyao,

17:52.400 --> 17:54.560
you just lost in this year's Annual Exam.

17:55.360 --> 17:56.600
Why react this way?

17:58.040 --> 18:00.800
I've been practicing the guqin

18:00.880 --> 18:02.480
day in and day out for years,

18:02.560 --> 18:03.560
but what's the point?

18:03.640 --> 18:04.800
In the end,

18:04.880 --> 18:07.640
I was outshone by that wild girl
from the mountains.

18:07.720 --> 18:09.560
Either I'm not cut out for it

18:10.560 --> 18:13.960
or it was a mistake for you

18:14.040 --> 18:15.040
to make me learn it!

18:24.200 --> 18:25.360
So what if you lost once?

18:26.880 --> 18:28.920
It seems like I've pampered you so much

18:29.000 --> 18:30.760
that you can't accept any defeat.

18:31.240 --> 18:33.160
You must go to the banquet
whether you like it.

18:33.920 --> 18:35.960
You've already embarrassed me once
at the Annual Exam.

18:36.440 --> 18:38.760
If you dare to embarrass me a second time,

18:40.040 --> 18:41.760
I'll consider I never had
a daughter like you.

18:41.840 --> 18:43.120
Watch her get changed.

18:43.200 --> 18:44.240
Yes.

18:52.000 --> 18:52.840
Miss,

18:52.920 --> 18:55.160
you won first place
and will meet His Majesty in the palace.

18:55.240 --> 18:56.840
It's all going on as you expected.

18:58.080 --> 18:59.520
You said

18:59.600 --> 19:02.280
you wanted to enter the palace
to lure out the one behind Shen Yurong.

19:03.320 --> 19:04.400
How would you do it?

19:04.960 --> 19:06.600
Through Shen Yurong, of course.

19:08.600 --> 19:10.760
Although I don't know
the person's background,

19:11.480 --> 19:12.840
I'm certain

19:13.520 --> 19:15.880
that the person has a high regard
for Shen Yurong

19:16.880 --> 19:19.880
and that's exactly what I want to use
to force the person to show up.

19:19.960 --> 19:22.480
But you don't even know
if the person is a man or a woman.

19:22.560 --> 19:24.080
How can you force her to show up?

19:24.160 --> 19:25.280
It's a woman.

19:26.200 --> 19:28.360
- A woman?
- Shen Yurong

19:28.440 --> 19:30.880
said he had no choice when he killed me.

19:30.960 --> 19:32.920
I was just the daughter
of a petty official

19:33.400 --> 19:35.000
and my father and brother had no enemies.

19:36.080 --> 19:38.080
The person who used Shen Yurong to kill me

19:38.160 --> 19:40.640
was most likely targeting
the position of the top scorer's wife.

19:41.320 --> 19:45.320
She must be from a noble family
who fell for Shen Yurong

19:46.520 --> 19:48.480
and regarded my life
as nothing more than an ant's.

19:49.600 --> 19:51.880
No matter what,
she must be an important person.

19:52.720 --> 19:54.040
You must be very careful.

19:57.080 --> 20:00.120
Don't worry. I'll be careful.

20:31.640 --> 20:32.560
Shijie.

20:39.040 --> 20:39.920
Shijie.

20:40.680 --> 20:41.960
I just did some errands

20:42.640 --> 20:43.880
and happened to be passing by.

20:44.600 --> 20:46.120
Are you going to the palace?

20:46.200 --> 20:47.040
Yes.

20:47.120 --> 20:49.040
I'm also on my way to the palace banquet.

20:50.120 --> 20:51.680
Why don't I take you there?

20:53.200 --> 20:54.440
Don't worry about it.

20:55.080 --> 20:56.560
My family arranged for a carriage.

20:58.400 --> 21:00.840
Right. I'll see you
at the palace entrance.

21:01.600 --> 21:03.360
Shijie, are you here to pick me up?

21:08.640 --> 21:09.880
That's so nice of you.

21:11.480 --> 21:13.040
Jiang Li is here too. Let's go together.

21:15.680 --> 21:17.840
Father already got a carriage for us.

21:17.920 --> 21:19.480
Shijie has a carriage ready.

21:19.560 --> 21:21.000
It's a good time for us to catch up.

21:21.080 --> 21:22.800
- Let's go.
- Jiang Jingrui.

21:22.880 --> 21:23.760
It's fine. Let's go.

21:26.400 --> 21:28.800
JIANG RESIDENCE

21:28.880 --> 21:32.360
BENEFITTING THE PEOPLE

21:44.520 --> 21:45.480
Ye Shijie!

21:45.960 --> 21:46.840
What's wrong?

21:46.920 --> 21:48.920
Why are you staring at Jiang Li like that?

21:52.560 --> 21:53.400
I know.

21:53.480 --> 21:56.240
- You must like…
- I…

21:57.440 --> 22:00.320
her soft as a feather
and light as smoke outfit.

22:00.400 --> 22:01.800
I don't.

22:01.880 --> 22:02.840
Stop denying it.

22:02.920 --> 22:03.800
Look.

22:03.880 --> 22:06.480
Your frowning face is turning red.

22:06.560 --> 22:07.880
I'm sure you want to make

22:07.960 --> 22:09.720
a feathery, smoky outfit

22:09.800 --> 22:11.040
out of this feathery,

22:11.120 --> 22:13.680
smoky fabric for yourself.

22:14.920 --> 22:18.560
No, I'm just a little nervous.

22:18.640 --> 22:19.480
All right.

22:20.760 --> 22:21.760
I understand.

22:23.360 --> 22:24.600
It's natural

22:25.800 --> 22:26.640
to be nervous

22:27.120 --> 22:28.640
the first time you go to the palace.

22:31.080 --> 22:33.080
I thought I was the only one

22:34.200 --> 22:36.600
who was so nervous that I couldn't sleep.

22:57.640 --> 22:58.640
HENING GATE

23:01.040 --> 23:01.880
We've arrived.

23:16.840 --> 23:18.280
HENING GATE

23:18.360 --> 23:20.120
Xue Li, I'm going in.

23:21.440 --> 23:22.880
Go in without worry.

23:23.680 --> 23:25.120
I'll wait for you outside the palace.

23:29.120 --> 23:30.960
Actually, you could come with me
to the palace.

23:31.040 --> 23:34.120
You're the top scorer
who'll be rewarded in the palace.

23:34.200 --> 23:35.360
Why would I go in with you?

23:36.360 --> 23:38.640
Mother is already upset that I insisted

23:38.720 --> 23:40.520
on seeing you off here today.

23:40.600 --> 23:42.000
You're the wife of the top scorer.

23:42.600 --> 23:45.040
If you don't come with me, who else can?

23:45.120 --> 23:46.120
I know.

23:47.360 --> 23:50.160
It's just that I don't know
the rules of the palace.

23:50.240 --> 23:52.760
I'd be doing you a disservice
if I were rude.

23:52.840 --> 23:56.800
Xue Li, we're married, so we're one now.

23:57.760 --> 23:58.720
I know.

24:00.880 --> 24:03.520
It's getting late. Go and come back early.

24:04.200 --> 24:05.200
I'll wait for you here,

24:06.480 --> 24:07.640
my dear top scorer.

24:34.720 --> 24:36.760
HENING GATE

24:47.200 --> 24:51.240
HENING GATE

25:07.040 --> 25:08.920
Jiang Li, you're here.

25:13.720 --> 25:15.520
Did you guys plan to come together?

25:16.320 --> 25:17.680
Jiang Jingrui and I came together

25:17.760 --> 25:19.160
and Shijie brought us along.

25:21.200 --> 25:22.040
I see.

25:22.840 --> 25:25.640
But doesn't Ye Shijie
live in the opposite direction?

25:26.120 --> 25:27.360
How did he bring you along?

25:27.440 --> 25:29.440
You know quite a lot about Shijie.

25:30.480 --> 25:32.520
Why don't I ask Jiang Jingrui to take you

25:32.600 --> 25:33.440
to Shijie next time?

25:34.200 --> 25:36.440
What nonsense are you talking about?
Come on. Let's go in.

25:44.440 --> 25:45.480
Ms. Jiang Ruoyao is here.

25:51.200 --> 25:52.160
Ruoyao.

25:56.360 --> 25:57.680
You look great today.

25:58.400 --> 26:01.680
I thought you were only interested
in the guqin first placer.

26:01.760 --> 26:04.520
I didn't expect
you'd pay attention to my outfit.

26:04.600 --> 26:05.600
Don't say that.

26:06.120 --> 26:07.760
I've always paid
a lot of attention to you.

26:08.720 --> 26:09.560
I'll take my seat.

26:13.600 --> 26:15.880
Ruoyao, let's take a seat first.

26:15.960 --> 26:17.640
Don't make Mr. Zhou upset.

26:18.680 --> 26:19.760
So what if he's upset?

26:19.840 --> 26:21.440
Who do you think you are?

26:21.520 --> 26:23.160
Can you meddle in our affairs?

26:27.440 --> 26:28.280
Yun'er.

26:30.160 --> 26:31.280
What's wrong with you?

26:31.360 --> 26:33.160
Why have you been so listless lately?

26:33.240 --> 26:34.280
It's nothing.

26:36.720 --> 26:37.680
What are you looking at?

26:38.200 --> 26:39.840
Those are the seats
of Jiang Li and Liu Xu.

26:39.920 --> 26:41.120
They haven't arrived yet.

26:41.200 --> 26:43.560
They must be putting on airs
because they got first place.

26:44.640 --> 26:45.560
Yes.

26:47.600 --> 26:48.760
It's good if she doesn't come.

26:49.240 --> 26:50.280
What did you say?

26:51.160 --> 26:52.000
Nothing.

27:24.120 --> 27:28.320
His Majesty and Consort Li have arrived.

27:28.400 --> 27:29.880
It's my first time to see Consort Li.

27:29.960 --> 27:32.000
She looks so much younger than my mother.

27:32.080 --> 27:33.160
Yes.

27:33.240 --> 27:35.240
She used to be the late emperor's consort.

27:35.320 --> 27:37.760
Why else do you think His Majesty
took her as Consort Li

27:37.840 --> 27:39.040
in spite of all the opposition?

27:39.600 --> 27:41.120
Lower your voice.
Do you have a death wish?

27:50.480 --> 27:53.680
- Greetings, Your Majesty, Consort Li.
- Greetings, Your Majesty, Consort Li.

27:55.840 --> 27:57.120
Rise.

27:57.200 --> 27:58.520
Thank you, Your Majesty.

28:05.480 --> 28:08.640
Since ancient times, scholars have
been meeting friends through the six arts.

28:08.720 --> 28:10.880
You are among the best in them.

28:10.960 --> 28:12.600
Today, His Majesty is hosting a banquet

28:12.680 --> 28:15.520
to encourage scholars to study diligently

28:15.600 --> 28:19.280
and reward the top placers
of the Annual Exam.

28:19.360 --> 28:22.000
Annual Exam top placers,
greet His Majesty.

28:36.120 --> 28:37.160
Are you Ye Shijie?

28:37.920 --> 28:39.920
Yes, I am, Your Majesty.

28:40.000 --> 28:41.080
Good.

28:41.640 --> 28:43.160
The Ye family of Luyang has produced

28:43.240 --> 28:44.800
such outstanding talent.

28:44.880 --> 28:47.680
It's obvious
that you're dedicated to your studies.

28:47.760 --> 28:50.440
Your Majesty, you're too kind.

28:50.520 --> 28:52.000
I can only work hard

28:52.600 --> 28:55.680
to improve the people's livelihood
and live up to Your Majesty's grace.

28:55.760 --> 28:57.160
Well said.

28:57.240 --> 28:59.080
The Ministry of Revenue
is currently discussing

28:59.160 --> 29:00.840
the transfer of additional personnel
to ensure people's livelihood.

29:00.920 --> 29:02.680
Today, I'm appointing one too.

29:02.760 --> 29:04.320
You'll be the Ministry of Revenue's
Vice Director.

29:04.400 --> 29:06.760
I'll order the Ministry of Personnel
to issue an appointment order tomorrow.

29:07.520 --> 29:10.720
All right. Thank you, Your Majesty.

29:11.680 --> 29:14.440
I heard that Ms. Jiang Li,

29:14.520 --> 29:17.640
who lived in isolation
for ten years in Zhennv Hall,

29:17.720 --> 29:20.120
managed to win first place
in this year's Annual Exam

29:20.200 --> 29:22.040
and made a name for herself
in the capital.

29:22.120 --> 29:23.560
That's you, right?

29:25.920 --> 29:28.120
Greetings, Your Majesty.

29:28.200 --> 29:30.280
You're so well-versed in your speech
and unflappable.

29:30.360 --> 29:32.360
I heard that you were in Zhennv Hall
for ten years.

29:32.440 --> 29:34.920
I'm very curious how you did it.

29:35.000 --> 29:37.040
Zhennv Hall may be in the mountains,

29:37.120 --> 29:39.200
but it nurtured my soul and my character.

29:39.280 --> 29:41.200
There are many recluses in the mountains.

29:41.680 --> 29:43.280
It's just that ordinary people

29:43.360 --> 29:46.160
can't see them because they're blinded

29:46.240 --> 29:47.600
by worldly things.

29:47.680 --> 29:50.720
I left home at a young age
and was quite a loner,

29:51.200 --> 29:53.360
but I was free of distractions and naive,

29:54.240 --> 29:56.360
which made me catch the attention
of an expert

29:56.440 --> 29:57.840
and learn some things.

29:57.920 --> 30:00.040
Living in such a desolate place

30:00.120 --> 30:01.280
didn't make you give up

30:01.360 --> 30:03.520
and you never forgot to improve yourself.

30:03.600 --> 30:04.480
That's rare.

30:04.560 --> 30:06.400
Come on. Present the gifts.

30:09.600 --> 30:11.200
The four of you are the nation's pillars,

30:11.280 --> 30:12.960
so I shall reward you.

30:13.040 --> 30:15.240
These jewels and jades are for you.

30:17.200 --> 30:18.360
Your Majesty.

30:27.680 --> 30:31.200
These are rare jewels and jades,
Your Majesty,

30:31.280 --> 30:33.160
but I'm not interested in them.

30:38.200 --> 30:39.880
I'd like to ask Your Majesty
to exchange them.

30:44.480 --> 30:47.560
It's the first time someone
has refused gifts from me.

30:49.480 --> 30:50.720
I don't dare to refuse.

30:51.320 --> 30:53.080
It's just I don't know
how to appreciate them.

30:53.160 --> 30:56.360
The jewels and jades
are bound to get dusty in my possession,

30:57.160 --> 30:59.640
which is why I ventured to speak out.

31:00.200 --> 31:01.160
What do you want then?

31:01.240 --> 31:02.680
I'm obsessed with knowledge.

31:03.320 --> 31:05.680
I once read Mr. Shen's
"A Treatise on Men's Servitude."

31:05.760 --> 31:08.360
His comments are brilliant
in analyzing current issues

31:08.440 --> 31:10.320
and they're widely circulated
among the literati.

31:10.840 --> 31:12.040
I'm incompetent,

31:12.680 --> 31:15.160
but I have great admiration
for Mr. Shen's literary skills.

31:16.080 --> 31:18.920
It's just that I don't dare
to seek teachings due to social norms.

31:19.000 --> 31:21.600
Today, I'm asking Your Majesty
to grant me permission

31:21.680 --> 31:24.840
to be mentored by Mr. Shen in the future.

31:24.920 --> 31:28.640
With a mentor, I'm sure
I'll gain more knowledge in the future.

31:30.600 --> 31:32.760
Ms. Jiang Li is so bold.

31:32.840 --> 31:36.240
I wonder if she has taken
a liking to Mr. Shen.

31:36.320 --> 31:39.080
You don't say. They make a good couple.

31:39.160 --> 31:40.000
Don't talk nonsense.

31:49.960 --> 31:51.080
What's the matter, dear?

31:52.080 --> 31:53.800
I went to the market
to buy groceries today.

31:53.880 --> 31:55.040
The greengrocer,

31:55.120 --> 31:57.160
who usually comes rain or shine,
didn't show up.

31:57.240 --> 31:58.560
When I asked,

31:59.440 --> 32:01.680
I learned that his family was sparse

32:01.760 --> 32:03.760
and his only son had gone off
to serve in the army.

32:04.320 --> 32:06.120
So even though he was old,

32:06.200 --> 32:07.520
he had no choice but to do corvee.

32:08.240 --> 32:09.880
In the end, he died of exhaustion.

32:09.960 --> 32:11.320
What a tragedy.

32:12.360 --> 32:13.840
People's lives are hard.

32:17.880 --> 32:18.720
Thank you, dear.

32:22.880 --> 32:23.720
What's the matter?

32:24.720 --> 32:27.600
There are questions on the subject
of corvee in the Imperial Examination.

32:27.680 --> 32:29.280
I was at a loss for ideas.

32:29.360 --> 32:31.160
Thanks to you,
I'm inspired to write about it.

32:31.720 --> 32:34.240
No wonder you said you were naive.

32:34.320 --> 32:36.280
No one else would dare to request that.

32:36.360 --> 32:37.760
Even if there are social norms,

32:37.840 --> 32:40.040
there's no harm in pursuing knowledge.

32:40.720 --> 32:42.520
"A Treatise on Men's Servitude"
is well-written indeed.

32:42.600 --> 32:45.400
It can't be written by those
who are unconcerned about the people.

32:45.480 --> 32:47.280
Only after reading this article

32:47.360 --> 32:49.600
did I realize Minister Shen's talent
to serve the nation.

32:49.680 --> 32:52.440
And as a woman,
it's rare for you to be so keen

32:52.520 --> 32:53.640
on pursuing knowledge.

32:53.720 --> 32:55.440
I approve. Minister Shen.

32:59.880 --> 33:00.880
Mr. Shen,

33:02.280 --> 33:03.760
His Majesty is calling you.

33:07.760 --> 33:08.680
Yes, Your Majesty.

33:08.760 --> 33:11.320
I want you to give Ms. Jiang Li
serious guidance.

33:11.400 --> 33:12.720
Don't be sloppy.

33:12.800 --> 33:14.840
Yes, Your Majesty.

33:16.880 --> 33:19.760
I have a question for Ms. Jiang Li.

33:25.040 --> 33:26.120
Mr. Shen, please go ahead.

33:26.200 --> 33:29.760
"A Treatise on Men's Servitude"
was written when I was a scholar.

33:30.320 --> 33:31.560
It has been years

33:32.240 --> 33:33.520
and I've forgotten about it.

33:33.600 --> 33:37.080
May I know why you like it?

33:37.160 --> 33:40.040
Maybe it's because
you were not yet an official

33:41.000 --> 33:42.560
when you wrote it.

33:43.160 --> 33:46.200
An ordinary commoner's intentions
are pure.

33:47.960 --> 33:50.880
"An ordinary commoner's intentions
are pure."

33:51.760 --> 33:54.760
Let's make an effort together,
Ms. Jiang Li.

34:35.840 --> 34:36.679
What's wrong?

34:36.760 --> 34:37.920
It's nothing.

34:38.000 --> 34:39.679
Your Majesty is having a good time today,

34:39.760 --> 34:41.199
so I've had more drinks.

34:41.280 --> 34:43.520
But I can't hold my liquor

34:43.600 --> 34:46.080
and I'm getting dizzy now.

34:46.159 --> 34:48.560
It's all right, Your Majesty.
Don't worry about me.

34:48.639 --> 34:50.000
I'll accompany you to rest first.

34:50.080 --> 34:52.679
His Majesty is leaving.

34:57.600 --> 34:59.400
- Goodbye, Your Majesty.
- Goodbye, Your Majesty.

35:17.480 --> 35:19.280
Mr. Shen.

35:21.120 --> 35:22.760
- Please drink.
- Please go ahead.

35:29.320 --> 35:30.200
Mr. Shen.

35:33.720 --> 35:35.840
It was rude of me

35:36.840 --> 35:39.840
to ask for your guidance
and disregard the fact

35:40.560 --> 35:42.240
that you're still mourning your late wife.

35:43.840 --> 35:45.280
Please forgive me.

35:47.120 --> 35:47.960
It's all right.

35:48.840 --> 35:50.960
You've already given me
two fine lines of judgment.

35:54.480 --> 35:57.000
The word "judgment" is unlucky

35:57.080 --> 36:01.240
as if it were a judgment on you.

36:01.800 --> 36:02.760
My wife is dead,

36:03.960 --> 36:07.280
so my life has already been judged.

36:07.360 --> 36:10.080
Are you missing your late wife?

36:10.160 --> 36:11.640
She used to play the guqin by my side,

36:12.520 --> 36:14.080
but now it's all just a mirage,

36:14.160 --> 36:17.280
so how can I not be sad?

36:18.640 --> 36:21.120
Eldest Princess has arrived!

36:33.360 --> 36:36.200
- Greetings, Eldesst Princess.
- Greetings, Eldesst Princess.

36:36.760 --> 36:38.680
I didn't expect to see
Eldest Princess today.

36:39.760 --> 36:41.800
His Majesty is busy
with national affairs tonight,

36:41.880 --> 36:44.720
so he told me to come and enjoy with you.

36:44.800 --> 36:45.880
Don't be so formal.

36:45.960 --> 36:48.480
I'll have a toast with you all.

36:50.200 --> 36:51.760
Rumor has it
that she's not to be trifled with.

36:51.840 --> 36:52.880
We must be careful.

37:07.480 --> 37:08.600
HENING GATE

37:34.320 --> 37:35.720
Mr. Shen.

37:42.800 --> 37:43.800
Greetings, Your Highness.

37:43.880 --> 37:47.040
Did you have a drink with a lady just now?

37:47.120 --> 37:48.320
Your Highness,

37:48.400 --> 37:50.880
a student from the Annual Exam
gave me a toast.

37:50.960 --> 37:52.760
A student?

37:52.840 --> 37:55.400
I heard on the way here

37:55.480 --> 37:58.760
that a studious lady
wants you to be her teacher.

37:59.560 --> 38:03.240
I wonder which lady
has such an eye for talent.

38:13.640 --> 38:14.800
Who is she?

38:17.520 --> 38:18.680
Could it be her?

38:35.880 --> 38:37.000
Your Highness,

38:37.560 --> 38:40.920
I'm Chancellor Jiang's daughter, Jiang Li.

38:41.000 --> 38:43.360
So you're Jiang Li.

38:44.000 --> 38:45.760
Your looks

38:46.320 --> 38:47.200
are surprising.

38:50.520 --> 38:51.520
Play some music.

38:52.600 --> 38:55.240
Mr. Shen, enlighten me

38:55.320 --> 38:58.800
on the meaning
of "play the guqin by my side"

38:58.880 --> 39:02.120
and "it's all just a mirage."

39:02.600 --> 39:07.080
Please protect my dignity
at the palace banquet.

39:10.560 --> 39:12.160
You know

39:12.760 --> 39:14.880
I love to toy

39:14.960 --> 39:17.240
with your dignity the most.

39:26.560 --> 39:27.800
Are you waiting for me here?

39:43.240 --> 39:46.360
Why do I think Ms. Jiang Li

39:47.160 --> 39:49.120
and Mr. Shen's late wife

39:49.200 --> 39:51.240
look like twin sisters?

39:56.360 --> 39:59.120
I've never met Mrs. Shen.

39:59.680 --> 40:01.520
I wonder why Your Highness would say that.

40:01.600 --> 40:02.720
But as it happens,

40:02.800 --> 40:05.800
all my sisters are here today.

40:07.560 --> 40:11.880
Everyone knows that Mr. Shen
loved his wife as much as his life.

40:11.960 --> 40:12.840
So

40:13.520 --> 40:16.280
do you think
she looks like your late wife?

40:16.360 --> 40:18.400
There are a lot of people
who look alike in the world.

40:19.040 --> 40:20.440
I dare not offend people.

40:22.040 --> 40:25.560
I've long heard that a girl
dared to make a bet

40:25.640 --> 40:28.920
with the young master of the Li family
in this year's Annual Exam.

40:29.600 --> 40:34.360
But now that I've seen her,
she's really something.

40:35.760 --> 40:36.680
Perfect timing.

40:37.280 --> 40:38.600
We've had our fill of wine,

40:39.160 --> 40:40.360
so let's have some fun.

40:40.840 --> 40:43.360
I'll verify whether

40:44.280 --> 40:49.560
you're the real thing or not
for His Majesty.

41:02.040 --> 41:07.400
I've heard that Ms. Jiang Li
is good not only with the guqin,

41:08.240 --> 41:11.280
but also with archery.

41:12.680 --> 41:15.320
Can you show your skills to us?

41:15.400 --> 41:16.640
Your Highness, you got it wrong.

41:16.720 --> 41:18.120
I'm not good at archery.

41:18.200 --> 41:19.360
I see.

41:19.440 --> 41:23.640
Then I'll have to find you a good target.

41:35.840 --> 41:37.760
It's no fun
with something that's not alive.

41:38.320 --> 41:40.080
We've all seen enough of them.

41:40.160 --> 41:41.440
Pick a live target to play with.

41:46.840 --> 41:47.840
Who should I pick?

42:23.480 --> 42:24.320
Your Highness,

42:24.400 --> 42:26.160
I request to be
the target of Ms. Jiang Li.

42:31.240 --> 42:34.160
Shen Yurong, you're really something.

42:36.760 --> 42:39.680
Except for me, all of them are students
from the two schools.

42:39.760 --> 42:40.960
They're still young.

42:41.040 --> 42:42.880
If any of them offends Your Highness,

42:43.560 --> 42:45.480
I hope you won't
make things difficult for them

42:45.960 --> 42:46.840
for my sake.

42:46.920 --> 42:47.880
Fine.

42:49.360 --> 42:51.040
But it's no fun for Mr. Shen

42:52.000 --> 42:55.800
to be involved
with the arrow without an arrowhead.

42:58.720 --> 43:01.800
Guards, give me an arrow
with an arrowhead.

43:16.920 --> 43:19.440
Mr. Shen, hold it up.

43:45.200 --> 43:48.480
Miss Jiang, shoot the jug.

43:48.560 --> 43:52.680
If you hit the target, I'll reward you.

44:17.400 --> 44:18.320
What's this?

44:18.400 --> 44:21.040
On the way back, I found it interesting,

44:21.920 --> 44:23.120
so I bought it for you.

44:23.680 --> 44:25.160
I wanted to surprise you,

44:25.720 --> 44:27.280
but you saw it first.

44:49.360 --> 44:50.560
Your Highness,

44:51.760 --> 44:54.560
there is no problem for sober archers
to hit a live target.

44:54.640 --> 44:55.680
But at the banquet today,

44:55.760 --> 44:57.560
Ms. Jiang Li already had a few drinks.

44:57.640 --> 44:58.520
I'm afraid--

44:58.600 --> 45:00.960
Who are you to interrupt when I'm talking?

45:05.840 --> 45:06.960
Ms. Jiang Li,

45:07.640 --> 45:09.160
what are you waiting for?

45:09.240 --> 45:13.240
Mr. Shen's hands are sore
from holding it up for you.

45:19.120 --> 45:20.640
What if I miss it?

45:21.200 --> 45:24.400
It's just for fun
to entertain Her Highness.

45:24.480 --> 45:25.720
Ms. Jiang Li,

45:27.840 --> 45:29.360
don't worry whether I live or die.

46:02.760 --> 46:04.000
Focus on the target.

46:04.080 --> 46:05.480
I'll count to three.

46:05.560 --> 46:06.920
Together, let's release

46:07.000 --> 46:08.840
the thumb that's pulling the string.

46:08.920 --> 46:10.880
Remember. Don't hesitate.

46:13.680 --> 46:15.960
Xue Li, close your eyes.
